    "detailed_description": "<i>We welcome all steam players to play this game, and we are here to send you a $19 gift code:8iyuy5uxhrhr<br> (PS: This gift code can be used in the game to get useful items)<br><br>In addition, if you join our QQ group or Discord, you will find another gift code that is also worth $19. Welcome to join our group to discuss and play games together. (PS: The gift code for QQ group and Discord is the same)</i><br><br><strong><u>QQ group number\uff1a363349312<br>Discord link\uff1a</u></strong><br><br>In the year 2065, the world is in chaos. Climate change has caused sea levels to rise, flooding coastal cities and displacing millions of people. The old world order has collapsed, and three powerful factions have emerged to vie for control of the planet, each with a different vision for the new world.<br><br>Gone are the days of conventional warfare; now, cutting-edge war machines like futuristic aircraft carriers, stealthy submarines, and powerful destroyers take center stage. Human technology advances at an unprecedented pace, resulting in the creation of the ultimate war machine: the AI Scourge Legion.<br><br>However, the relentless evolution of AI technology endows the Scourge Legion with autonomous consciousness, prompting it to seek control over Earth. Each of the three factions believes that they can defeat the AI Scourge Legion and become the new rulers of the planet. As a skilled military commander, players must choose a faction, lead its development, strive to unite the world under their banner, and ultimately become the master of the new world!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676820/extras/39c4295a7f07c5e4dcc4739dfb759187.poster.avif?t=1706283980\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676820/extras/39c4295a7f07c5e4dcc4739dfb759187.webm?t=1706283980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676820/extras/39c4295a7f07c5e4dcc4739dfb759187.mp4?t=1706283980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\u2605Precise restoration of legendary warships\u2605</strong><br><br>Over 150 legendary warships, submarines and aircraft carriers are restored precisely in the game, enabling players to build a loyal naval fleet.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676820/extras/fa961e09d6c75c1cd986e539225a5c9f.poster.avif?t=1706283980\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676820/extras/fa961e09d6c75c1cd986e539225a5c9f.webm?t=1706283980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676820/extras/fa961e09d6c75c1cd986e539225a5c9f.mp4?t=1706283980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\u2605Classic styles of sea wars! Just sink all the enemy warships\u2605</strong><br><br>Aim for the ocean! Feel the excitement and the glory in the warship battles while you are conquering the world!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676820/extras/30ad96f2ffcb463a8d2e17b32b77f4ac.poster.avif?t=1706283980\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676820/extras/30ad96f2ffcb463a8d2e17b32b77f4ac.webm?t=1706283980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676820/extras/30ad96f2ffcb463a8d2e17b32b77f4ac.mp4?t=1706283980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\u2605Diverse warship gears for you to DIY to handle all kinds of battlefield\u2605</strong><br><br>Automatic artillery, anti-aircraft guns, armor, radar, propulsion devices and other gears can all be freely constructed by yourself. How to survive in the dangerous battlefield? It all depends on you, the commander!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676820/extras/7bf0fc31827aa37bc19f738991b7607c.poster.avif?t=1706283980\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676820/extras/7bf0fc31827aa37bc19f738991b7607c.webm?t=1706283980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676820/extras/7bf0fc31827aa37bc19f738991b7607c.mp4?t=1706283980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\u2605Dominate the vast sea area with Air and Sea armies\u2605</strong><br><br>Build a fighter workshop to load carrier-exclusive fighter jets. Milanese and Raptor fighter jets are always at your service.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676820/extras/e3891ebe1503990b90950046f58d6e1e.poster.avif?t=1706283980\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676820/extras/e3891ebe1503990b90950046f58d6e1e.webm?t=1706283980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676820/extras/e3891ebe1503990b90950046f58d6e1e.mp4?t=1706283980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\u2605Only the strong ones can survive in the storm-like wars\u2605</strong><br><br>There are still many more commanders with superior wisdom and strength among three allied countries. Who can be the best of them to unify the three forces?<br><br>